{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "85Top: Traffic Madness!",
    "steam_appid": 3753090,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753090/extras/16ffaf8dbe577f4fa2ca04457626294c.avif?t=1755156152\" data-has-big width=800 height=333 /></span>THE LIFE OF AN APP DRIVER HAS NEVER BEEN SO CRAZY (AND FUN)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get in your car, turn on the sound and step on it without any mercy, because downtown Fortaleza has become your race track!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 85Top, you are an app driver in a hot, chaotic, vibrant \u2014 and absolutely real \u2014 city. Here, the passenger calls and whoever gets there first gets the ride. The competition is fierce, the forr\u00f3 never stops, and the horn is almost your secret weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the classic Crazy Taxi, with a hint of Need for Speed, 85Top is a game that is Brazilian to the core, with one proposal: to transform the daily grind of an app driver into a true urban adventure \u2014 stylish, fast and full of personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753090/extras/0c55f3900681ff1ddbe760e1128a0ecc.poster.avif?t=1755156152\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753090/extras/0c55f3900681ff1ddbe760e1128a0ecc.webm?t=1755156152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753090/extras/0c55f3900681ff1ddbe760e1128a0ecc.mp4?t=1755156152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753090/extras/eda8398e59cd182fecb695eb6b48a8b0.avif?t=1755156152\" width=426 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RACING WITH NOTES AND MONEY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You pick up passengers, take them to their destination and are evaluated with stars \u2014 the better your performance, the more money goes into your account. Just don't forget to avoid potholes, red lights, cars, buses and impatient motorcyclists!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIERCE COMPETITION BETWEEN APP DRIVERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, there are other drivers trying to pick up the same passengers as you. Did you see a call on the map? Speed \u200b\u200bup, because this is a real race! Whoever gets there first wins \u2014 and don't be stingy with the horn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A FORTRESS YOU'VE NEVER SEEN LIKE THIS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit historic and iconic sites in the city center, such as Pra\u00e7a do Ferreira, and much more. It's the daily life of the capital of Cear\u00e1 recreated in a stylized and soulful look.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A HIGH-PLAYING FORRO SOUNDTRACK</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the traffic is raging, you drive to the rhythm of a great forro. There's nothing better than avoiding the traffic jam accompanied by the accordion, the bass drum and those vocals that are almost like an emotional GPS.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>URBAN TRAFFIC TURNED INTO FUNNY CHAOS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buses blocking intersections, motorcycle taxis weaving in out of nowhere, traffic lights flashing during rush hour... It's almost like a &quot;make do&quot; simulator \u2014 but with nitro, drift and that touch of humor from Cear\u00e1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753090/extras/3b3dc6840a9e029d0a657a098762387e.webp?t=1755156152\" width=426 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because this game is a tribute to the day-to-day workers, to the crazy rush of those who do everything with good humor, and to the vibrant culture of a city full of life, sounds, and human warmth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >85Top is not just a racing game \u2014 it's a chronicle of improvising with style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add it to your wishlist now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753090/extras/a2d37ace83f11b6a617a0e993d94865f.avif?t=1755156152\" width=555 height=354 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When it launches, you'll want to be on the front line, with your finger on the accelerator and the radio at full volume.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traffic in Fortaleza has never been so much fun \u2014 and you've never been so ready to face it with courage and forr\u00f3 in your heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753090/extras/7e9d2a305950f9cc76700194654f7df2.poster.avif?t=1755156152\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753090/extras/7e9d2a305950f9cc76700194654f7df2.webm?t=1755156152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753090/extras/7e9d2a305950f9cc76700194654f7df2.mp4?t=1755156152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753090/extras/16ffaf8dbe577f4fa2ca04457626294c.avif?t=1755156152\" data-has-big width=800 height=333 /></span>THE LIFE OF AN APP DRIVER HAS NEVER BEEN SO CRAZY (AND FUN)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get in your car, turn on the sound and step on it without any mercy, because downtown Fortaleza has become your race track!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 85Top, you are an app driver in a hot, chaotic, vibrant \u2014 and absolutely real \u2014 city. Here, the passenger calls and whoever gets there first gets the ride. The competition is fierce, the forr\u00f3 never stops, and the horn is almost your secret weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the classic Crazy Taxi, with a hint of Need for Speed, 85Top is a game that is Brazilian to the core, with one proposal: to transform the daily grind of an app driver into a true urban adventure \u2014 stylish, fast and full of personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753090/extras/0c55f3900681ff1ddbe760e1128a0ecc.poster.avif?t=1755156152\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753090/extras/0c55f3900681ff1ddbe760e1128a0ecc.webm?t=1755156152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753090/extras/0c55f3900681ff1ddbe760e1128a0ecc.mp4?t=1755156152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753090/extras/eda8398e59cd182fecb695eb6b48a8b0.avif?t=1755156152\" width=426 height=54 /></sp