team/apps/3753090/extras/3b3dc6840a9e029d0a657a098762387e.webp?t=1755156152\" width=426 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because this game is a tribute to the day-to-day workers, to the crazy rush of those who do everything with good humor, and to the vibrant culture of a city full of life, sounds, and human warmth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >85Top is not just a racing game \u2014 it's a chronicle of improvising with style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add it to your wishlist now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753090/extras/a2d37ace83f11b6a617a0e993d94865f.avif?t=1755156152\" width=555 height=354 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When it launches, you'll want to be on the front line, with your finger on the accelerator and the radio at full volume.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traffic in Fortaleza has never been so much fun \u2014 and you've never been so ready to face it with courage and forr\u00f3 in your heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753090/extras/7e9d2a305950f9cc76700194654f7df2.poster.avif?t=1755156152\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753090/extras/7e9d2a305950f9cc76700194654f7df2.webm?t=1755156152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753090/extras/7e9d2a305950f9cc76700194654f7df2.mp4?t=1755156152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "85Top is an arcade racing game inspired by Crazy Taxi, with the fast pace of Need for Speed \u200b\u200band the heat of downtown Fortaleza! Pick up passengers, compete with other app drivers, earn money and get a 5-star rating \u2014 all this with passing through historic landmarks in the city.",
